-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  prj_inside_err_other.pcpp - Projects: a file in a project that is not its
  main module

  Break step of prj_inside: this file sits beside the project's main module,
  but project.toml names prj_inside.pcpp as main, so this one builds as a
  plain file (user 2026-10-29). A plain build has no project, so its $R: names
  nothing.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe prj_inside_err_other;

/*
  @@test
    kind error
  @@end
*/

@addmodulepath "$R:units"; // ERROR PR0065@16: has no project

begin
end.
